WEBVTT

00:04.398 --> 00:05.519
you.

00:27.000 --> 00:31.162
The lights are dimming in the hall, the shadows

00:31.262 --> 00:35.944
climbing up the wall. We check the dials, turn

00:36.024 --> 00:40.826
the wheel, but there is nothing left to feel. The

00:41.027 --> 00:45.329
engine shudders, then I stops. The pressure in

00:45.389 --> 00:50.091
the chamber drops. It's just a fading spark, a

00:50.151 --> 00:54.267
flicker in the growing dark. We're running out

00:54.307 --> 00:59.178
of time and space Inside this hollow, empty

00:59.298 --> 01:01.743
place The Fading Spot

01:07.793 --> 01:11.975
You search the wiring for a sign, you trace the

01:12.075 --> 01:17.078
path of every line. The system crashes one by one

01:17.738 --> 01:22.101
until the work is left undone. We build a

01:22.201 --> 01:26.423
fortress way too high, and watch the coal hours

01:26.463 --> 01:30.800
bleed and die. It's just a fading spark. A

01:30.880 --> 01:35.241
flicker in the growing dark We're running out of

01:35.561 --> 01:40.522
time and space Inside this hollow, empty place

01:40.882 --> 01:48.463
The fading spark

01:55.805 --> 02:01.545
Is I over? Is I done? Waiting for the fadding sun

02:01.565 --> 02:07.437
No one's left to play the part Hide the secret in

02:07.497 --> 02:08.339
your heart

02:46.341 --> 02:53.783
It's just a fading spark A flicker in the growing

02:53.823 --> 02:59.304
dark We're running out of time and space Inside

02:59.344 --> 03:04.625
this hollow, empty place The fading spark

03:09.019 --> 03:13.986
Fade to grey. Fade to black. Fade to grey.

